--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on catalog.dat: All columns in the gaiaedr3.gaia_source catalogue (I/350)
   are copied over for both components. We also include the columns source_id,
   parallax, parallax_error, pmra, pmdec, pmra_error, pmdec_error, and ruwe
   from Gaia DR2 (I/345) for both components; these have the prefix "dr2".
   Columns ending in "1" and "2" refer to the primary and secondary component,
   respectively. The primary is always the component with the brighter Gmag.
Note on shift.dat: It contains the same columns as the binary candidate
   catalogue, except the columns source_id, parallax, parallax_error, pmra,
   pmdec, pmra_error, pmdec_error, and ruwe from Gaia DR2 (I/345). Because one
   component of each pair has been shifted from its true position in the
   gaia_source catalogue (I/350), the RA and DE columns in it do not match those
   reported in the gaia_source catalogue.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

